--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 63900ac93b90d764abfce22b4b5e61b6, type: 3}
  m_Name: cutScene2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: 'Jadi itu adalah moster karang turi. '
    pfp: {fileID: -8178650773239659235, guid: 5652f932eb4f44348904375402acaca5, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: Itu moster hasil perjanjian leluhur kami yang membuat lahan kami jadi subur.
    pfp: {fileID: -8178650773239659235, guid: 5652f932eb4f44348904375402acaca5, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: "Dulu desa ini tidak bisa ditanami karna yaahhh, seperti yang kalian lihat,
      air di desa ini tidak bisa dipakai, sudah seperti ini dari dulu. \r"
    pfp: {fileID: -8178650773239659235, guid: 5652f932eb4f44348904375402acaca5, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: Jadi leluhur kami membuat perjanjian dengan moster itu untuk membuat tanah
      ini menjadi subur.
    pfp: {fileID: -8178650773239659235, guid: 5652f932eb4f44348904375402acaca5, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: Tapi dia membutuhkan tumbal setiap beberapa tahun.
    pfp: {fileID: -8178650773239659235, guid: 5652f932eb4f44348904375402acaca5, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Tari
    text: "Dan bapak mau numbalin kami? \r"
    pfp: {fileID: -7149292610794270421, guid: 1193ad44da02961469345881e82e0d46, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Bima
    text: "Tega banget pak. \r"
    pfp: {fileID: -6218296853217754512, guid: 63fabdce159583a4d878400a99ff0823, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: Bapak minta maaf.
    pfp: {fileID: -8178650773239659235, guid: 5652f932eb4f44348904375402acaca5, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: Tapi ini satu satunya cara untuk membuat desa ini jadi subur.
    pfp: {fileID: -8178650773239659235, guid: 5652f932eb4f44348904375402acaca5, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: Karna tidak mungkin menanan tanaman kalau kondisi air seperti ini.
    pfp: {fileID: -8178650773239659235, guid: 5652f932eb4f44348904375402acaca5, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: Nahh, kalo soal air pak.
    pfp: {fileID: -716451372785500452, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: 'Kami sebenernya kesini buat ngenalin teknologi pemurnian air pak. '
    pfp: {fileID: -716451372785500452, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: Jadi desa ini gak perlu lagi perjanjian dengan moster itu.
    pfp: {fileID: 8660902975792385251, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: Gak mudah buat batalin perjanjian itu. Ini perjanjian leluhur, bahkan saya
      gak tau caranya.
    pfp: {fileID: -8178650773239659235, guid: 5652f932eb4f44348904375402acaca5, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
